  "title": "Envela Added to Membership of US Small-Cap Russell 2000 Index",
  "summary": "IRVING, TX / ACCESS Newswire / June 24, 2025 / Envela Corporation was added as a member of the US small-cap Russell 2000® Index, effective after the US market opens on June 30 as part of the 2025 Russell indexes reconstitution. Membership in the Russell 2000® Index, which remains in place for one year, is […]",
